//ない。わからないから、急ぐしかない」
"Time will be of the essence. Oyumi is one thing, but GHQ is another entirely. It's impossible to predict what they'll do. And that's why we have to hurry."

//【署長】
<voice name='署長' class='署長' src='voice/mb03/0040560a11'>
//「最悪の事態がもしも明日訪れるのならば、
//今日中に備えを済ませることでしか対処でき
